  "notes": {
    "s1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "WHAT CHANGES\n\n• Login: the empty top half becomes the brand (logo, tricolour rule, live market line). Labels sit above fields. Language switch on the first screen.\n• Lock setup: explains what the lock does; fingerprint first; \"Not now\" is a quiet text button.\n• Lock: greets you by name; one bank-form box per PIN digit; the error line has a fixed slot so the keypad never jumps; fingerprint on the keypad.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 2980,
      "y": 0
    },
    "s2": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "WHAT CHANGES\n\n• Same layout, same two taps. Chart keeps most of the screen.\n• Balance in Indian grouping (₹9,99,600.00), labelled \"Demo balance\".\n• Amount written in words under the figure, like a cheque (stops a stray zero).\n• Buy/Sell become Up/Down with arrows and show what you get back if you win.\n• Open trade reads like a pending passbook entry.\n• Trade length sheet shows the exact time the trade ends.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 2980,
      "y": 1244
    },
    "s3": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "WHAT CHANGES\n\n• Your trades: a small ledger (time, trade, result) with Won/Lost rubber stamps and a day total.\n• Markets: category chips (Crypto, India, Forex, starred), price + change per row, closed markets say so with their opening time.\n• Deposit bonus: a plain table, gold only on the next tier; the withdrawal rule stays in words above the button.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 2980,
      "y": 2488
    },
    "s4": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "MONEY FLOWS\n\n• Payments: the account as a passbook cover; withdrawable vs bonus split.\n• Deposit: amount + words, bonus earned, then the UPI app.\n• UPI pay: QR, installed-app buttons, auto status.\n• Receipt: perforated, stamped CREDITED, UTR, new balance.\n• Withdraw: limits up front, prefilled UPI ID, amount repeated on the button.\nNames, amounts, IDs and the VPA are examples.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 3732
    },
    "s5": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "HISTORY + ACCOUNT\n\n• History is a real passbook page: Particulars, Debit, Credit, running Balance, grouped by day.\n• Payment detail: tracking timeline; held withdrawal can be cancelled.\n• Account: identity + KYC stamp, settings in three short groups.\n• Verify identity: the four steps listed up front.\n• Document photo: card-shaped saffron guide, torch, gallery fallback.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 4976
    },
    "s6": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "PROMPTS\n\n• Notifications: asked after the first Live trade ends, never at launch, with a preview of the notification.\n• Update required: what happened, that the balance is safe, one action. Maintenance and VPN blocked reuse this pattern.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 6220
    },
